(O103 - Touch Plate Z Offset)
(Probes Z down to touch plate, sets work offset)
(Requires: [PROBE] PLATE_THICKNESS, VEL, SEARCH_DIST in LinuxCNC INI)
(Usage: Position over touch plate, then call)

O103 sub

    #<plate_thickness> = #<_ini[PROBE]PLATE_THICKNESS>
    #<probe_vel> = #<_ini[PROBE]VEL>
    #<search_dist> = #<_ini[PROBE]SEARCH_DIST>

    M5
    M9
    G90
    G40
    G49

    (Fast probe down)
    G91
    G38.2 Z-#<search_dist> F[#<probe_vel> * 4]
    G0 Z2.0

    (Slow probe for accuracy)
    G38.2 Z-4.0 F#<probe_vel>

    (Set Z work offset to plate thickness)
    G10 L20 P0 Z#<plate_thickness>

    (Retract)
    G0 Z5.0
    G90

    (MSG, Z offset set to #<plate_thickness>)

O103 endsub
M2
